  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/10/ArtDeLaLlumDiaDeLaFoto.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 408px\" /></p>\n<p>Este s&aacute;bado, 11 de octubre, la agrupaci&oacute;n fotogr&aacute;fica L&#39;Art de la Llum de Onda ha celebrado su D&iacute;a de la Foto anual en la plaza de Espa&ntilde;a. Todas las personas que han querido han podido fotografiarse y recoger su foto media hora despu&eacute;s. Todo en 80 fotos.<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diafotoartllum111014/artdelallumdiadelafoto.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diafotoartllum111014/img_6468.jpg\" alt=\"img_6468\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diafotoartllum111014/img_6470.jpg\" alt=\"img_6470\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diafotoartllum111014/img_6471.jpg\" alt=\"img_6471\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diafotoartllum111014/img_6472.jpg\" alt=\"img_6472\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diafotoartllum111014/img_6474.jpg\" alt=\"img_6474\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diafotoartllum111014/img_6475.jpg\" alt=\"img_6475\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diafotoartllum111014/img_6476.jpg\" alt=\"img_6476\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diafotoartllum111014/img_6477